{"id":"423555","name":"虫草花沙骨汤","author":"harriet1003","authorId":"8268096","desc":"","cover":"images/423555/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"沙骨","amount":"300克"},{"name":"虫草花","amount":"200克"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"6个"},{"name":"香菇","amount":"3朵"},{"name":"生姜","amount":"一块"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"新鲜沙骨，洗净备用。","img":"images/423555/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"虫草花洗净备用。","img":"images/423555/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"香菇，红枣。","img":"images/423555/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"沙骨放开水里过血水。","img":"images/423555/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"拿出冲掉泡沫。","img":"images/423555/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把骨头分别放三个炖盅内。","img":"images/423555/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入虫草花、红枣、香菇和姜片。","img":"images/423555/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入开水。","img":"images/423555/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放蒸锅内，盖上里盖。","img":"images/423555/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"盖上外盖和锅盖，大火烧开炖半小时后调小火炖三个半小时关火。","img":"images/423555/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"打开盖子，放入少许的盐。","img":"images/423555/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"好喝到停不下来！","img":"images/423555/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"1、盐一定要少放。\n2、沙骨也可以换成排骨或者瘦肉。\n3、这是三个人的量，一盅差不多两个饭碗。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炖盅、蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}